WEBVTT

00:06.506 --> 00:08.341
[sweet airy music]

00:42.042 --> 00:46.504
YOUTH DOCUMENTARY
OUR BELOVED SUMMER

00:48.465 --> 00:50.258
[voice over] Do you remember these two

00:51.468 --> 00:54.304
from an early summer around ten years ago?

00:54.387 --> 00:55.555
[sighs]

00:56.806 --> 00:59.768
Kook Yeon-su really exhausts people.

00:59.851 --> 01:01.853
Why does she live such an exhausting life?

01:01.936 --> 01:04.981
Early birds just get tired earlier.

01:05.065 --> 01:07.859
What on earth is he going to do
when he grows up?

01:07.942 --> 01:09.861
We can sleep all we want when we're dead.

01:10.570 --> 01:13.406
I'm certain now that he's going to be
lazy his whole life.

01:13.490 --> 01:15.617
[voice over] These two young 19 year-olds

01:15.700 --> 01:19.579
became the center of attention,
creating a lot of meme-worthy moments.

01:20.163 --> 01:21.664
Were they "loved" by people?

01:21.748 --> 01:23.416
I enjoyed the documentary too.

01:24.000 --> 01:25.293
They were kind of

01:26.002 --> 01:27.337
really immature.

01:27.420 --> 01:29.631
At first, I thought it was only Ung.

01:29.714 --> 01:33.384
But now I think,
Yeon-su was more immature.

01:33.468 --> 01:34.511
No, actually,

01:35.345 --> 01:36.763
they're both a mess.

01:36.846 --> 01:37.806
Hey!

01:38.598 --> 01:41.017
Kook Yeon-su! You psycho!

01:41.100 --> 01:42.060
[Ung] Damn it!

01:43.311 --> 01:44.395
[soft gasp]

01:50.360 --> 01:51.694
I thought you were a ghost!

01:54.197 --> 01:55.532
It may seem so to you viewers,

01:55.615 --> 01:57.283
but in fact,
they weren't always bickering.

01:57.867 --> 02:00.870
They were bound to grow on each other
since they were always together.

02:01.538 --> 02:04.207
And I could feel
something else is there too.

02:04.290 --> 02:06.000
You get it, right?

02:06.084 --> 02:08.419
[Eun-ho] Anyway,
I figured it was quite intriguing.

02:08.503 --> 02:10.964
MORNING, AN ALLEYWAY IN HWIYEONG-DONG

02:11.047 --> 02:12.340
You're three minutes late.

02:13.424 --> 02:14.551
Just three minutes?

02:14.634 --> 02:16.678
That's like three years
to seniors like us.

02:17.470 --> 02:18.555
Don't be ridiculous.

02:18.638 --> 02:21.099
I now go to school
30 minutes earlier thanks to you.

02:21.182 --> 02:24.477
Exactly, that's the point.
I'm helping you save a lot of time.

02:24.561 --> 02:27.313
Gosh, do we have
to walk to school together?

02:29.149 --> 02:30.233
Hey.

02:35.238 --> 02:36.489
No, thanks.

02:36.573 --> 02:39.033
This isn't from me. It's from my mom.

02:39.117 --> 02:42.078
Do you even have breakfast
if you go to school this early?

02:43.329 --> 02:44.289
[Ung sighs]

02:44.372 --> 02:45.456
Thanks.

02:47.458 --> 02:48.543
Hey.

02:49.419 --> 02:51.504
Was it you who borrowed volume three?

02:51.588 --> 02:52.589
Yeah.

02:53.256 --> 02:54.841
Can you just let me read in peace here?

02:54.924 --> 02:56.634
Well, I'm a speedy reader.

02:56.718 --> 02:58.553
Can you let me read it first?

03:00.763 --> 03:01.973
[voice over] Maybe that's why

03:02.599 --> 03:05.768
many people are wondering
how they're doing these past few days.

03:05.852 --> 03:07.604
WILL WE GET TO SEE THEM AGAIN
AFTER 10 YEARS?

03:07.687 --> 03:08.855
I don't know.

03:08.938 --> 03:11.733
I doubt it'll be that easy for us
to get them in front of the camera again.

03:11.816 --> 03:13.568
For one thing, many years have passed.

03:13.651 --> 03:17.196
And as you all know, they weren't…
weren't exactly on friendly terms.

03:17.280 --> 03:19.532
Plus, now that I think about it,

03:19.616 --> 03:22.577
I know it was tense. I know for a fact

03:22.660 --> 03:23.703
that they don't get along.

03:24.329 --> 03:25.705
Oh. Let's do a retake.

03:25.788 --> 03:27.999
Hmm, to be honest, I doubt it'll be easy.

03:28.082 --> 03:29.709
WHAT'S YOUR IDEAL TYPE?

03:29.792 --> 03:31.544
Someone who's super kind. I guess.

03:31.628 --> 03:35.089
Petite, adorable, with a round face.

03:35.173 --> 03:36.925
Someone who'll love me deeply.

03:37.008 --> 03:38.676
Someone I can always be with--

03:38.760 --> 03:40.345
You should just get a dog then.

03:41.554 --> 03:46.517
If I were to have a crush on someone,
he'd be the coolest person alive.

03:48.561 --> 03:50.855
[voice over] We spent
that summer watching them.

03:50.939 --> 03:51.814
[sighs]

03:52.398 --> 03:54.567
You might be wondering,
"How are they doing now?"

03:54.651 --> 03:56.778
- One thing's for sure…
- One thing I know for sure is that--

03:56.861 --> 03:59.322
…I'd have nothing to do
with this pathetic person beside me.

03:59.906 --> 04:01.991
[scoffs]
That's exactly how I feel.

04:06.037 --> 04:08.748
["Summer Rain" by Sam Kim playing]

04:38.319 --> 04:44.158
EPISODE 12
BEGIN AGAIN

04:58.673 --> 05:00.341
How did you find out about it?

05:02.593 --> 05:03.928
Hmm…

05:05.221 --> 05:07.265
Everything seems to be a blur.

05:09.600 --> 05:11.144
I think I just came to know.

05:17.692 --> 05:20.194
[Yeon-ok crying]

05:33.291 --> 05:35.084
[soft sorrowful music]

05:40.006 --> 05:41.758
[Ung] The earliest memory

05:43.342 --> 05:46.262
I have was of that day.

05:47.764 --> 05:52.018
Every fall, around this time,
or to be exact, this day…

05:54.687 --> 05:56.105
Strangely,

05:57.106 --> 06:00.568
they're always sad on this day.

06:02.445 --> 06:05.073
Back then, I didn't know.

06:05.156 --> 06:06.699
I only realized it later.

06:10.995 --> 06:14.373
That's when I began
having those nightmares.

06:18.836 --> 06:19.712
[young Ung] Dad!

06:21.089 --> 06:22.882
Dad, where are you?

06:22.965 --> 06:25.927
[Ung] Nightmares
I've been abandoned by someone.

06:26.010 --> 06:27.053
Dad!

06:32.266 --> 06:33.184
[Ung] Worst of all,

06:34.018 --> 06:37.230
I didn't know who I was even looking for.

06:37.313 --> 06:40.149
- [Yeon-ok] Hello.
- [Ho] Yes, please come on in.

06:40.233 --> 06:41.275
[Yeon-ok] Good morning.

06:41.359 --> 06:42.819
Thank you.

06:43.653 --> 06:45.988
- Ung! Good day to you.
- [Ho] Come on in.

06:46.656 --> 06:49.033
Are you hungry, son?
Would you like me to make hotteok for you?

06:49.117 --> 06:51.202
[Ung] But I knew

06:51.285 --> 06:53.121
- that I wasn't looking…
- [Yeon-ok] Wait here.

06:53.204 --> 06:55.373
- …for my parents.
- [Yeon-ok] Hello!

07:00.586 --> 07:01.921
That's all.

07:03.381 --> 07:04.423
There's not much to it.

07:06.801 --> 07:10.972
I guess I was lucky to have been adopted
by such great parents.

07:11.639 --> 07:12.807
Do any of them know?

07:13.891 --> 07:15.393
That I know about it?

07:16.936 --> 07:19.647
No. I didn't tell them.

07:26.362 --> 07:27.947
You must have been lonely.

07:34.036 --> 07:35.997
It must have broken your heart.

07:36.706 --> 07:39.000
How did you endure it all by yourself?

07:45.465 --> 07:47.633
[Yeon-su] I want to comfort you…

07:51.429 --> 07:53.681
but I don't know how to even help you.

07:57.268 --> 07:59.270
And I don't know what to say.

08:00.730 --> 08:01.939
You already have.

08:02.982 --> 08:04.400
Hmm?

08:04.484 --> 08:07.487
You're here by my side
and listening to my story.

08:08.613 --> 08:09.822
That's enough.

08:13.367 --> 08:15.578
[gentle music]

08:24.629 --> 08:25.796
Are you leaving already?

08:27.131 --> 08:28.132
[Yeon-su] Don't worry.

08:29.342 --> 08:31.093
I'll leave once you fall asleep.

08:33.721 --> 08:34.847
Mm.

08:38.017 --> 08:40.770
I really have trouble sleeping. You know?

08:41.479 --> 08:42.855
Hmm.

08:43.648 --> 08:44.982
But strange,

08:45.816 --> 08:47.568
I'm only able to sleep…

08:50.530 --> 08:52.532
when you are by my side.

08:57.703 --> 08:58.829
[Ung] Yeon-su.

09:25.106 --> 09:27.817
- Ho!
- Oh, hey, Chang-sik.

09:27.900 --> 09:31.028
Oh, you acted like it won't be long,
but you closed down for days.

09:31.112 --> 09:32.989
I was bored to death, you know.

09:33.072 --> 09:35.074
Well, since we already went down there,

09:35.157 --> 09:37.910
we decided to stay longer
and look around a bit.

09:37.994 --> 09:39.620
What's gotten into you?

09:39.704 --> 09:41.622
You normally work
all year round, through the holidays.

09:41.706 --> 09:44.208
Oh, well you know, the weather was lovely.

09:44.292 --> 09:46.752
You should have taken me along with you.

09:46.836 --> 09:50.006
How could you go without me
when you knew I was all alone, huh?

09:50.089 --> 09:52.091
You hurt my feelings, you know.

09:53.092 --> 09:54.260
All right, Chang-sik.

09:54.927 --> 09:57.597
There's this term
kids nowadays like to use, see?

09:57.680 --> 10:00.099
It's called "B.I.B.O."

10:00.182 --> 10:01.559
"B.I." what now?

10:01.642 --> 10:03.686
Listen to me, it basically means
you should know

10:03.769 --> 10:06.480
when to butt in and butt out.
You understand, huh?

10:06.564 --> 10:08.691
Oh. So?

10:10.401 --> 10:14.822
Okay, you know what you are?
You are being a "B.I.B.I."

10:15.781 --> 10:18.659
- What do you mean?
- Oh gosh, you're so slow-witted.

10:18.743 --> 10:19.994
Just stop butting in! Got that?

10:20.077 --> 10:21.203
- Gosh.
- [Ji-ung] Hey, Dad.

10:21.287 --> 10:22.705
Oh, Ji-ung.

10:22.788 --> 10:24.915
- When'd you come back?
- We came back yesterday.

10:24.999 --> 10:27.710
Wait, just hold on.
Are you going to work already?

10:27.793 --> 10:29.462
- Actually, I'm coming from work.
- Huh?

10:29.545 --> 10:31.839
I need to get changed at home,
then head back.

10:31.922 --> 10:33.382
- Goodness.
- [Chang-sik] Are you still filming?

10:33.466 --> 10:36.636
I didn't get much screen time lately.
So, don't you need me?

10:36.719 --> 10:38.429
- Oh, jeez.
- [Ji-ung] We're done filming.

10:38.512 --> 10:41.515
- We had our final shoot several days ago.
- Oh, congratulations.

10:41.599 --> 10:44.977
I bet Ung was quite difficult
to deal with. Thank you for everything.

10:45.061 --> 10:47.063
But why in the world did you cast Ung?

10:47.146 --> 10:49.565
That boy is so quiet and boring as hell.
I really don't--

10:49.649 --> 10:51.859
I'm sure Ji-ung has his reasons.

10:51.942 --> 10:53.861
You really have no clue, do you?

10:53.944 --> 10:57.782
Do you have any idea
how popular my son really is right now?

10:57.865 --> 11:00.076
I'm asking you, Chang-sik.
Do you have any idea?

11:00.159 --> 11:02.119
- [Chang-sik] No need to yell.
- Answer me right now.

11:02.203 --> 11:05.998
All right, fine.
Jeez, no need to snap at me.

11:06.540 --> 11:10.086
So, Ji-ung. Now that you're done,
what will you be filming next, huh?

11:10.169 --> 11:12.296
- If this is getting aired on TV…
- [annoyed sigh]

11:12.380 --> 11:15.424
…you should film my hardware store
and tell everyone

11:15.508 --> 11:19.136
that we sell a ton of great tools.
The kind that…

11:19.220 --> 11:21.055
Ow! Stop that, will you?

11:21.138 --> 11:22.681
Ignore him. Please ignore him.

11:22.765 --> 11:24.141
You must be feeling tired.

11:24.225 --> 11:26.977
If you've been working
right up until now, Ji-ung, then

11:27.061 --> 11:28.646
doesn't that mean you stayed up all night?

11:28.729 --> 11:30.564
[chuckles]
Oh, no, I slept a bit at work.

11:30.648 --> 11:34.318
If I'm filming anything interesting again,
I'll make sure to let you know.

11:34.402 --> 11:36.153
- Sure. Okay.
- Well, I should get going.

11:36.237 --> 11:38.531
- Oh, go on then. Come by for a meal later.
- I will.

11:38.614 --> 11:40.116
Okay. Bye.

11:40.866 --> 11:42.368
What a well-mannered kid.

11:43.035 --> 11:46.705
So different from yours,
but their names are similar.

11:46.789 --> 11:47.748
Don't you need to go?

11:50.418 --> 11:51.585
[phone buzzing]

11:54.004 --> 11:55.172
Hey, what is it?

11:56.882 --> 11:58.175
No, I'm fine.

11:59.635 --> 12:02.221
I just went home
to get a change of clothes. Hmm.

12:04.306 --> 12:06.600
No, it's fine. Set it up. I'll be there.

12:07.351 --> 12:08.352
Hmm.

12:15.109 --> 12:16.652
[sighs]

12:41.302 --> 12:43.012
[cheeky music]

12:43.929 --> 12:46.015
Are you expecting a call from someone?

12:46.098 --> 12:47.475
What? No.

12:47.558 --> 12:50.436
Then hurry up and dig in already.

12:50.519 --> 12:51.770
All right, fine.

13:05.159 --> 13:06.452
- [phone buzzing]
- [gasps]

13:07.620 --> 13:10.498
Hey, watch it! It's dripping on the floor!

13:11.540 --> 13:12.791
Wasn't it my phone?

13:12.875 --> 13:13.876
No, it's mine.

13:17.838 --> 13:19.548
What's with her?

13:21.008 --> 13:22.843
I'm leaving now, grandma.

13:35.523 --> 13:38.859
I can always just call him first
after all. It's no big deal.

13:44.490 --> 13:46.492
What if he just fell asleep?

13:49.954 --> 13:52.915
Or maybe he might still be up right now.

14:02.216 --> 14:04.009
- Oh.
- [yawns]

14:04.093 --> 14:05.344
You're here.

14:05.970 --> 14:06.971
[Yeon-su] When did you arrive?

14:07.930 --> 14:09.014
You should have called.

14:09.890 --> 14:11.475
I came after work.

14:12.226 --> 14:14.019
Do you leave for work at this hour?

14:14.103 --> 14:16.355
I would have left sooner
if you told me you'd come.

14:17.022 --> 14:18.148
So, did you get some sleep?

14:20.859 --> 14:22.403
No, I wasn't sleepy.

14:22.987 --> 14:26.657
Hey. You need to stop staying up
all night just because you're not sleepy.

14:26.740 --> 14:28.033
Have you been drinking jujube tea?

14:28.117 --> 14:29.743
You should still try to sleep you know.

14:29.827 --> 14:32.246
How can you fall asleep
when you're out and about?

14:32.329 --> 14:34.874
You're not going to take
some sleeping pills now, are you?

14:34.957 --> 14:38.460
[Yeon-su] I told you before, those pills
aren't good for you in the long run.

14:38.544 --> 14:40.629
You may not go cold turkey,
but you should still try--

14:40.713 --> 14:41.630
Are you done?

14:43.257 --> 14:47.970
I'm just saying that you should've
stayed home and tried to sleep instead.

14:49.013 --> 14:51.515
I'd rather be here right now.

14:53.767 --> 14:56.312
What's that face? Are you happy or not?

14:57.521 --> 14:58.689
I'm feeling ecstatic.

14:59.899 --> 15:02.276
Then you should've just said so
from the get-go.

15:02.359 --> 15:04.069
Let's go. I'll drive you.

15:04.653 --> 15:06.488
You mean to work? I can just take the bus.

15:06.572 --> 15:08.157
It's quicker by car.

15:08.240 --> 15:09.575
Hey. You shouldn't be driving

15:09.658 --> 15:11.410
- when you haven't slept a wink. That's--
- Hey.

15:11.493 --> 15:13.078
There you go again.

15:13.162 --> 15:15.080
But at least
let me drive you to the bus stop.

15:15.164 --> 15:16.498
Is that fine?

15:16.582 --> 15:18.208
Hmm. That's fine.

15:19.376 --> 15:21.962
Why is it that you nag me
every time I say something?

15:22.046 --> 15:24.256
It's only because you keep worrying me.

15:24.340 --> 15:25.257
I'm not a kid.

15:25.341 --> 15:27.384
Exactly. So when will you grow up, Ung?

15:38.729 --> 15:41.148
And when will you grow up, Kook Yeon-su?

15:46.862 --> 15:48.447
You think you can ditch work today?

15:50.783 --> 15:52.284
Forget it.

15:52.368 --> 15:55.287
Come on. Just one day will be fine.

15:55.371 --> 15:57.289
I can't just skip work.

15:57.373 --> 15:59.792
And there's no need
for you to drop me off.

15:59.875 --> 16:01.335
Just go home and sleep.

16:01.835 --> 16:03.671
But you said I could.

16:03.754 --> 16:06.006
I changed my mind, don't follow me.

16:11.720 --> 16:12.888
Hey, Choi Ung.

16:13.514 --> 16:15.265
I have a question to ask you.

16:16.225 --> 16:17.559
So, are we dating again?

16:18.435 --> 16:20.354
Did you think we weren't all this time?

16:21.063 --> 16:23.649
I mean, I just wanted to be sure.

16:25.067 --> 16:26.568
I thought it couldn't be more obvious.

16:29.488 --> 16:30.531
Ung.

16:32.741 --> 16:34.827
I hope we get along.

16:38.831 --> 16:40.416
He's so straightforward.

16:42.167 --> 16:43.585
She's so adorable.

16:44.336 --> 16:46.880
[soft cheerful music]

17:00.894 --> 17:04.231
- Are you going to keep staring?
- Do you have good news or something?

17:04.732 --> 17:06.650
- Why?
- Well,

17:07.234 --> 17:09.987
I'm not really sure
as to what's gotten into you now,

17:10.070 --> 17:12.448
but you've been coming here to eat often.

17:13.615 --> 17:14.908
So how did your trip go?

17:14.992 --> 17:18.871
Hmm, good. We enjoyed
the autumn leaves on our way home.

17:18.954 --> 17:20.456
We took a lot of photos too.

17:20.956 --> 17:22.082
Look.

17:23.333 --> 17:26.253
Look at this. Isn't it beautiful?

17:26.336 --> 17:28.047
Yes, it sure is.

17:28.922 --> 17:31.592
Resting certainly
made me want to take a longer break.

17:32.134 --> 17:34.928
You think we should just
close down the restaurants for good?

17:35.012 --> 17:36.930
I've been telling you to do that.

17:37.014 --> 17:39.308
Just enjoy and spend your S.C.

17:39.975 --> 17:41.810
S.C? What is that?

17:41.894 --> 17:42.853
"Son's card."

17:42.936 --> 17:46.690
Ooh! That sounds lovely.
[chuckles]

17:48.901 --> 17:50.486
You should have brought me along too.

17:51.904 --> 17:52.780
With us?

17:53.697 --> 17:54.698
[chuckles awkwardly]

17:54.782 --> 17:56.867
You don't really like the countryside.

17:56.950 --> 17:58.827
And we thought you'd be busy.

18:00.496 --> 18:01.789
No. It's okay.

18:03.082 --> 18:05.584
I'm really fine, mom.
There's always next time.

18:07.795 --> 18:09.797
Okay. We will.

18:12.049 --> 18:14.093
Hey, Ung, my boy.

18:14.760 --> 18:17.888
I heard that you're done
filming the documentary.

18:17.971 --> 18:19.306
Is that true?

18:20.390 --> 18:22.309
Isn't it about time
that you stayed with us again

18:22.392 --> 18:25.312
and went back to being
the restaurant's cashier?

18:25.395 --> 18:30.818
Ho, Ung here told me to quit
and just use my S.C.

18:30.901 --> 18:32.778
S.C? What's and S.C?

18:32.861 --> 18:34.947
Don't you know? It's "son's card."

18:35.030 --> 18:38.200
What? Hey, son. What about me?

18:38.283 --> 18:41.036
You should do something
that's even better and more popular.

18:41.120 --> 18:42.079
And what is that?

18:42.162 --> 18:43.497
M.A.L.F.Y.

18:43.580 --> 18:45.958
M.A.L.F.Y?

18:46.041 --> 18:49.169
- Is that something better?
- Of course. It's so much better.

18:49.711 --> 18:51.630
It means, "Making a life for yourself."

18:54.007 --> 18:54.967
Thanks for the meal.

18:55.050 --> 18:57.261
- Be sure to come by for dinner too.
- "Making…"

18:57.344 --> 18:59.888
- I'll make dumpling soup.
- Please, don't tempt me with food.

18:59.972 --> 19:03.058
That's the only way I can bring you here.
[chuckles]

19:04.017 --> 19:05.394
Wait. "Making a…"

19:10.107 --> 19:12.234
- Mr. Park.
- Oh, Tae-hun, what?

19:12.317 --> 19:15.279
- Where are your seniors right now?
- They're in a meeting with Ms. Lee.

19:15.362 --> 19:16.697
How was the filming?

19:17.364 --> 19:19.992
Mr. Choi and Ms. Kook
were interviewed in the last part.

19:20.784 --> 19:21.785
Uhm…

19:22.286 --> 19:23.328
What?

19:24.496 --> 19:27.249
Well, it was rather strange.
They didn't even look at each other.

19:27.332 --> 19:29.001
No, not them.

19:29.084 --> 19:32.171
You know, did anything interesting happen?

19:32.254 --> 19:35.132
You know, between Chae-ran and Ji-ung.

19:35.215 --> 19:37.134
Please don't ask about them anymore.

19:37.217 --> 19:39.219
I don't think it's right
to tell of it, sir.

19:39.928 --> 19:43.140
- Say what?
- Also, if you keep asking me about them

19:43.223 --> 19:45.559
because you think
they have feelings for each other,

19:45.642 --> 19:47.436
then I definitely can't say anything.

19:47.519 --> 19:51.315
I don't think it's right to suspect
your colleagues of doing things like that.

19:51.398 --> 19:53.025
Also, why do you think

19:53.108 --> 19:56.069
Ms. Jung and Mr. Kim
have something going on between them, sir?

19:56.653 --> 19:59.406
They're hardworking people
who are only focused on…

19:59.489 --> 20:00.782
[gasps]

20:00.866 --> 20:02.159
M… Ms… Ms. Jung.

20:04.536 --> 20:07.289
Is this really
what you've been up to recently?

20:08.290 --> 20:11.043
Hmm? What? Me?

20:13.587 --> 20:17.674
Oh, him?
He always stands there and rambles on.

20:17.758 --> 20:20.510
I thought he was just practicing
for some sort of speech.

20:20.594 --> 20:22.638
- Why are you here anyway?
- What?

20:22.721 --> 20:24.514
[Chae-ran] You have too much
time on your hands, don't you?

20:24.598 --> 20:26.308
I always let you go home early,

20:26.391 --> 20:28.310
but I guess you have
nothing better to do with your energy.

20:28.393 --> 20:30.103
No, Ms. Jung. That isn't true--

20:30.187 --> 20:32.022
It seems I won't be lenient
with you anymore.

20:32.689 --> 20:34.316
You're pulling an all-nighter.

20:34.399 --> 20:35.692
[Tae-hun grunts]

20:35.776 --> 20:36.902
Hello?

20:36.985 --> 20:39.321
Uh… Ms… Ms. Jung, I…

20:39.404 --> 20:40.447
- [Dong-il] Hello?
- Mr. Park.

20:40.530 --> 20:42.032
- Mr. Park.
- Yes?

21:05.764 --> 21:07.015
Are we ready yet?

21:07.099 --> 21:08.100
[Tae-hun] Yes.

21:14.606 --> 21:18.193
Oh, right. Can I ask,
what was the last question again?

21:18.277 --> 21:20.279
[Chae-ran] The last question
we asked you is,

21:20.362 --> 21:22.364
"What will you be doing
ten years from now?"

21:26.952 --> 21:28.870
[soft sweet music]

21:50.851 --> 21:52.978
- Ji-ung, are you okay?
- What?

21:53.061 --> 21:55.647
You didn't look too good
during the meeting earlier.

21:55.731 --> 21:57.983
You've been pulling too many
all-nighters recently,

21:58.066 --> 22:01.153
- so how about you go home for tonight.
- I'm fine.

22:02.279 --> 22:05.782
You really don't look fine.
I think you should go home for tonight.

22:05.866 --> 22:07.659
You look like you could faint.

22:07.743 --> 22:09.786
It's better to faint over here
than at home.

22:10.495 --> 22:12.247
- What?
- [chuckles sadly]

22:12.331 --> 22:13.665
Never mind.

22:13.749 --> 22:16.835
If I get too exhausted,
I'll go home, so don't you worry.

22:22.174 --> 22:23.091
[Ji-ung sighs]

22:23.175 --> 22:24.426
[keyboard clacking]

22:28.805 --> 22:31.683
Look at you.
You're running a fever here, Ji-ung!

22:31.767 --> 22:32.809
This won't do. Get up from there.

22:32.893 --> 22:35.771
- I'm really fine.
- I'm kicking you out. Now go.

22:35.854 --> 22:37.022
Hey.

22:37.105 --> 22:38.940
- Hey.
- [Chae-ran] Go on.

22:40.150 --> 22:42.444
I'll be using this room tonight.
And you're not allowed in.

22:43.320 --> 22:44.821
Hey? What's going on?

22:45.530 --> 22:46.656
He's going home right now.

22:46.740 --> 22:49.618
[Chae-ran] He's running a fever,
so he might get us sick too.

22:50.118 --> 22:51.787
- Hey, come on. It's not that bad.
- What is it?

22:52.662 --> 22:54.206
The flu?

22:54.289 --> 22:55.874
Go home, okay?

22:55.957 --> 23:00.545
I suffered from a terrible flu last time.
Stop bothering her, just leave!

23:00.629 --> 23:02.130
Now, get home safe.

23:03.840 --> 23:06.176
Why is she overreacting all of a sudden?

23:07.010 --> 23:10.764
Hey, Ji-ung. Don't you think
she's just worried about you?

23:10.847 --> 23:13.433
You know, you're really slow-witted, huh?

23:13.517 --> 23:14.851
[Dong-il] Just go home.

23:15.435 --> 23:16.394
And don't upset her.

23:16.978 --> 23:18.146
What do you mean?

23:20.899 --> 23:23.985
I mean, she… she hasn't been able
to go home ever since

23:24.069 --> 23:26.113
you started pulling all-nighters in here.

23:26.696 --> 23:29.950
Oh, but… but I told her
she could go home first.

23:30.033 --> 23:31.993
Does she still feel bad about that?

23:32.911 --> 23:35.080
Do you seriously think that's why?

23:35.956 --> 23:36.832
[sighs]

23:36.915 --> 23:39.960
You know what?
Forget it. You're a lost cause.

23:40.043 --> 23:41.211
How frustrating.

23:43.296 --> 23:45.006
[Dong-il] So frustrating.

23:46.925 --> 23:48.051
[sighs]

23:58.270 --> 23:59.646
[gags softly]

23:59.729 --> 24:00.981
Who would drink this?

24:02.065 --> 24:03.733
[sighs in disgust]

24:09.406 --> 24:10.448
[sighs happily]

24:11.408 --> 24:12.742
[inhales deeply]

24:13.660 --> 24:15.787
[cheeky music]

24:18.415 --> 24:19.708
[inhales deeply]

24:24.004 --> 24:26.131
What in the world is wrong with him, huh?

24:30.218 --> 24:31.511
Gosh, that's hot.

24:32.345 --> 24:35.432
Will you please focus for a minute?
We have so much to do today.

24:37.475 --> 24:39.686
They published the interview
you did last time.

24:41.646 --> 24:42.647
[Eun-ho] Now, let's see.

24:43.607 --> 24:46.735
They would like to use
some of your drawings for the documentary.

24:46.818 --> 24:50.197
Should I pick them out myself?
Or will you talk to Ji-ung about it?

24:51.781 --> 24:54.159
Well? Give it some thought.

24:55.035 --> 24:58.371
Oh, by the way, I haven't seen him
ever since the filming ended.

24:58.455 --> 24:59.539
Is he that busy?

24:59.623 --> 25:01.666
Also, the gallery just called.

25:01.750 --> 25:03.418
You wanted to see
the night lighting, right?

25:03.501 --> 25:05.712
Well, they said you could come today.
So shall we go?

25:05.795 --> 25:08.590
No. Not today.

25:09.174 --> 25:10.342
I have something to do.

25:11.009 --> 25:12.260
Is it another drawing?

25:14.304 --> 25:15.472
[sighs]

25:16.306 --> 25:19.017
Then Ye-in will be in charge
of the online marketing.

25:19.100 --> 25:20.310
Myeong-ho, please help her.

25:20.393 --> 25:21.770
- Okay.
- Okay.

25:21.853 --> 25:24.856
I think you've all become too lax
after finishing a big project.

25:24.940 --> 25:27.567
We still have one big project
in the second half of the year.

25:27.651 --> 25:29.402
So I'd like us to focus on that.

25:29.486 --> 25:30.695
- Okay.
- Okay.

25:30.779 --> 25:32.447
That'll be all. Good work, everyone.

25:43.667 --> 25:46.586
[Yeon-su] Would you like
to have dinner together later?

25:50.131 --> 25:51.466
[chuckles awkwardly]

25:52.092 --> 25:54.094
I left my pen behind.

25:55.845 --> 25:57.681
[light music]

26:04.771 --> 26:07.107
[Ung] Something came up.
So I'm afraid I can't.

26:07.190 --> 26:10.443
Really? Wasn't he the one
who asked me to ditch work?

26:12.946 --> 26:14.114
Is he sulking?

26:16.032 --> 26:17.325
[Yeon-su] Why?

26:19.077 --> 26:20.287
What came up?

26:22.747 --> 26:24.040
Are you sulking…

26:26.751 --> 26:27.711
Okay.

26:32.966 --> 26:35.593
[light music]

26:42.350 --> 26:43.518
[sighs]

26:44.060 --> 26:46.396
[Ji-ung] This place never feels welcoming.

26:51.526 --> 26:52.694
[groans]

26:56.448 --> 26:58.783
I'll just rest for a minute.

26:59.617 --> 27:01.494
[tired breathing]

27:06.249 --> 27:08.043
[gentle music]

27:16.593 --> 27:18.386
[dial tone]

27:20.138 --> 27:22.515
[system] The person
you're calling is unavailable…

27:31.900 --> 27:33.193
[doorbell ringing]

27:39.449 --> 27:41.659
[doorbell ringing]

27:50.794 --> 27:53.129
[system] The person
you're calling is unavailable…

27:55.882 --> 27:58.093
[gentle music]

28:08.978 --> 28:10.188
[groans]

28:16.820 --> 28:17.987
[Ji-ung] Why are you…

28:18.696 --> 28:19.739
You have a fever.

28:22.367 --> 28:23.243
[groaning sigh]

28:27.163 --> 28:28.498
It's bearable.

28:29.958 --> 28:33.336
You're right.
It actually doesn't seem that bad.

28:34.379 --> 28:35.505
When'd you get here?

28:35.588 --> 28:36.798
A while ago.

28:37.465 --> 28:39.968
I had to learn how to stuff a pill
through a sleeping man's throat.

28:40.593 --> 28:42.470
What a bummer. Take this.

28:49.436 --> 28:52.897
How come your place has no human's warmth?

28:54.482 --> 28:55.775
I'm not human, am I?

28:58.778 --> 29:00.155
Why are you sick?

29:03.491 --> 29:05.034
What kind of question is that?

29:05.118 --> 29:07.954
I mean, you've always been proud
of your health.

29:08.037 --> 29:09.914
So I can't help but feel curious.

29:10.999 --> 29:13.918
What did you do to get sick like this

29:14.002 --> 29:16.129
and throw a pity party for yourself?

29:18.173 --> 29:19.257
Nothing much.

29:20.341 --> 29:22.427
I just pulled
a few all-nighters. That's all.

29:23.428 --> 29:24.971
[Ji-ung] I'm going back to bed.

29:25.054 --> 29:26.431
I won't see you out.

29:35.899 --> 29:37.233
You look like you have something to say.

29:38.693 --> 29:39.861
Mm.

29:41.362 --> 29:42.405
[Ung] But…

29:43.281 --> 29:46.701
I'm not sure if I should
since you're sick right now.

29:57.587 --> 29:58.505
[groans]

30:01.800 --> 30:03.593
Then can I not hear it?

30:04.886 --> 30:06.262
Yeon-su and I are dating again.

30:06.346 --> 30:07.597
[chuckles]

30:09.390 --> 30:11.434
So I had no choice in the end.

30:15.897 --> 30:18.650
Okay. Why are you telling me this?

30:20.985 --> 30:23.780
Just because,
I've always wanted to tell you first.

30:24.364 --> 30:26.699
It's been that way both
in the past and the present.

30:28.451 --> 30:29.869
[panting]

30:31.704 --> 30:33.915
I got a girlfriend.

30:38.336 --> 30:39.879
And yet once again,

30:41.089 --> 30:42.465
I have nothing to say.

30:45.844 --> 30:47.428
Should I congratulate you then?

30:49.806 --> 30:50.765
No, that's okay.

30:53.226 --> 30:54.477
Now, if there's nothing else

30:56.271 --> 30:58.898
- can I go back to bed?
- Mm.

31:00.567 --> 31:01.901
[sighs]

31:04.195 --> 31:05.363
One more thing.

31:05.446 --> 31:06.573
Hmm?

31:07.824 --> 31:09.784
Can you please get lost?

31:09.868 --> 31:10.952
[chuckles softly]

31:11.619 --> 31:12.912
Mm.

31:16.749 --> 31:18.793
[gentle music]

31:26.009 --> 31:27.343
[phone buzzing]

31:28.011 --> 31:28.970
Oh!

31:30.972 --> 31:32.891
[groans in pain]

31:34.809 --> 31:37.729
[whimpers]

31:40.481 --> 31:41.566
[pants]

31:41.649 --> 31:43.318
[phone continues buzzing]

31:48.156 --> 31:50.033
[in strained voice]
Yes, hello?

31:50.116 --> 31:51.910
Mm, are you up?

31:51.993 --> 31:52.952
Yeah.

31:54.495 --> 31:57.749
I woke up a while ago.
I'm about to go out.

31:58.249 --> 32:00.335
And you? Did you not sleep again?

32:00.418 --> 32:02.045
No, I slept a bit.

32:05.048 --> 32:08.468
Uh… and breakfast.
Did you get to eat anything?

32:08.551 --> 32:10.136
Have some, then go to bed.

32:10.803 --> 32:11.888
Okay.

32:13.348 --> 32:14.682
Are you going to work?

32:14.766 --> 32:16.684
Mm-hmm. Yes, I am.

32:17.268 --> 32:18.311
I see.

32:18.394 --> 32:19.646
That's right.

32:20.229 --> 32:21.147
[chuckles awkwardly]

32:23.274 --> 32:25.735
Well, what are you doing this weekend?

32:25.818 --> 32:27.195
This weekend?

32:27.278 --> 32:28.780
Mm-hmm, thi… this weekend.

32:29.364 --> 32:31.157
Do you want to hang out if you're free?

32:31.240 --> 32:33.785
Uh… This weekend…

32:33.868 --> 32:35.912
But if you're too busy, it's okay.

32:35.995 --> 32:39.874
No. I'm free this weekend.
Yeah. Let's meet.

32:40.583 --> 32:41.793
Hmm. Okay.

32:43.086 --> 32:44.379
Okay.

32:44.462 --> 32:47.799
I think I should get to work now.
I'm hanging up.

32:47.882 --> 32:48.925
Okay.

32:53.346 --> 32:56.349
Oh. Why do I feel so awkward?

32:57.767 --> 33:00.269
Just be yourself, Yeon-su. Okay?

33:01.020 --> 33:04.607
[whines dramatically]
Maybe I shouldn't have asked him out.

33:05.650 --> 33:07.151
[whining]

33:10.905 --> 33:13.282
[Yeon-su] Gosh. It feels so awkward.

33:13.366 --> 33:15.243
[Yeon-su whining]

33:16.160 --> 33:17.704
What are you doing?

33:19.539 --> 33:21.332
- What?
- Aren't you going to work?

33:21.416 --> 33:24.419
I… I am. I'm leaving right now.

33:33.302 --> 33:36.055
She's been acting
so weird since yesterday.

33:36.764 --> 33:37.890
Hold on.

33:38.725 --> 33:40.268
I have a weird feeling.

33:42.228 --> 33:43.521
[groans]

33:47.483 --> 33:48.568
[steadying exhale]

33:49.360 --> 33:51.738
When was the last time
we talked on the phone?

33:51.821 --> 33:53.114
Should I call her again?

33:53.781 --> 33:55.158
No, I shouldn't.

33:56.534 --> 33:57.368
[sighs]

33:57.452 --> 34:00.204
Gosh, what's going on here?
Is this water park now?

34:01.914 --> 34:03.291
[Ung] Oh!

34:04.125 --> 34:06.836
Where's your head at?
Are you still asleep?

34:07.628 --> 34:10.089
This'll be a pain. Good luck.

34:10.173 --> 34:13.051
- Wait, can you clean this?
- But…

34:14.343 --> 34:15.636
I didn't come here to clean.

34:15.720 --> 34:17.138
[Eun-ho] Oh, come on!

34:17.221 --> 34:19.724
I'm your manager, not your errand guy.

34:20.975 --> 34:25.396
I mean, I did ask him out first,
but he sounded kind of reluctant.

34:25.480 --> 34:27.857
It's like he didn't seem
too excited about it.

34:27.940 --> 34:29.525
So, did he refuse you?

34:30.109 --> 34:31.486
Uh, no, he didn't.

34:32.028 --> 34:34.572
Even so,
it keeps bothering me for some reason.

34:34.655 --> 34:36.532
Did he feel forced to go out with me?

34:36.616 --> 34:37.992
[Sol-i] But the date is still on.

34:38.076 --> 34:40.995
What? Did you expect him
to be all ecstatic about it?

34:41.079 --> 34:43.122
Hey, you're not
teenagers anymore, you know?

34:43.206 --> 34:46.793
But still. It was so unlike him
to react that way.

34:47.293 --> 34:48.377
He's so weird.

34:48.461 --> 34:50.546
[Sol-i] Do you know what
the weirdest thing is right now?

34:50.630 --> 34:51.714
What is it?

34:51.798 --> 34:54.592
It's the fact that
you were the one who called me first.

34:55.343 --> 34:57.637
You were the one
who made the effort to call me

34:57.720 --> 34:59.764
while you're still in the middle of work.

35:00.598 --> 35:02.975
I'm not at work. I'm driving to work.

35:03.059 --> 35:04.644
[Sol-i] You used to be such a rude brat

35:04.727 --> 35:08.356
who'd tell me to be brief with my call
since you were driving.

35:08.439 --> 35:10.233
But now you called me first,

35:10.316 --> 35:12.944
and here you are
rambling to me about Choi Ung.

35:13.528 --> 35:15.655
Well, that's because--

35:15.738 --> 35:18.116
Okay. Who do you think
is the one who has changed?

35:18.699 --> 35:21.702
Go on, who's the weirder one here?
Try to guess.

35:21.786 --> 35:25.039
Anyway, stop worrying over it.
Just follow your heart.

35:25.623 --> 35:27.542
[Sol-i] I mean, it took you this long
to get back together.

35:27.625 --> 35:31.337
So stop hesitating
and step up already. I'm hanging up.

35:31.420 --> 35:34.382
Wait, what? I can't believe I said that.

35:34.465 --> 35:37.635
Hang up! Hang up already!

35:38.678 --> 35:41.180
[sighs happily]
That felt so nice.

35:41.764 --> 35:43.891
What an adorable, little brat.

35:43.975 --> 35:46.686
[sighs]
Why have I become so timid?

35:49.981 --> 35:52.483
Has dating always been this difficult?

35:55.278 --> 35:56.571
[groaning sigh]

36:03.202 --> 36:04.412
[Ja-gyeong] What's going on?

36:04.495 --> 36:06.372
[Sol-i] Ung and Yeon-su
are going out again.

36:06.455 --> 36:08.040
- Are you serious?
- Mm-hmm.

36:09.959 --> 36:11.043
[sighs]

36:11.127 --> 36:14.672
Why did they hesitate for so long
if they were going to get back together?

36:19.760 --> 36:21.554
- So how do you feel?
- Hmm?

36:21.637 --> 36:25.057
I know that you don't really like him.

36:25.141 --> 36:27.393
Oh, my opinion doesn't matter.

36:27.476 --> 36:29.729
She likes him, so what can I even say?

36:30.438 --> 36:31.355
[Sol-i chuckles]

36:31.439 --> 36:34.358
I still have my doubts.
What if he's not a healthy boy?

36:35.026 --> 36:36.903
I'm pretty sure he is.

36:37.945 --> 36:40.907
Yet again, I am concerned
about his mental health.

36:42.241 --> 36:43.242
He's a bit…

36:44.368 --> 36:48.414
Never mind. Anyway, I'll keep an eye
on them. So don't you worry about a thing.

36:49.999 --> 36:53.169
Or should I fix her up with another man?

36:53.252 --> 36:54.795
I mean, there are still

36:54.879 --> 36:57.798
plenty of wonderful candidates
out there, you know.

36:58.466 --> 37:01.677
Oh no, it's okay.
Don't bother. Leave her be.

37:01.761 --> 37:02.887
Eat this.

37:03.471 --> 37:05.056
[Ja-gyeong] It's fine.

37:05.139 --> 37:06.432
You must actually like him, huh?

37:06.515 --> 37:09.727
Not at all. Why would I like
that good-for-nothing boy?

37:10.311 --> 37:12.355
Then what are you waiting for?

37:13.105 --> 37:15.149
I should find her a good man

37:15.233 --> 37:17.777
before I get older and it's too late.

37:18.402 --> 37:21.155
I don't have much time left. Yes.

37:21.822 --> 37:24.075
I have to see him again while I still can.

37:24.158 --> 37:26.827
[client] The building is quite large
and there are many shops here.

37:26.911 --> 37:27.912
[Yeon-su] I see.

37:29.330 --> 37:31.916
- It looks like it's three stories tall.
- That's right.

37:31.999 --> 37:34.418
[breezy music]

37:36.254 --> 37:37.505
[client] It would certainly be nice

37:37.588 --> 37:39.632
if you could take
plenty of videos in this area.

37:40.800 --> 37:43.469
In fact, the sunset
looks quite beautiful from up here.

37:43.552 --> 37:45.012
Oh, I see. I'll let them know.

37:45.096 --> 37:46.681
Do you have any other requests?

37:47.265 --> 37:50.434
Hmm. I'm sure that you'll do
a great job with everything else.

37:51.143 --> 37:52.687
Let me check the time.

37:53.271 --> 37:55.106
You can actually see the sunset right now.

37:55.189 --> 37:57.149
You can take a look around
with your colleague.

37:57.233 --> 37:58.901
Oh. I'm here alone today.

37:58.985 --> 38:00.403
But I'll drop by
with them again next time.

38:01.612 --> 38:03.322
I thought you came with him.

38:05.533 --> 38:07.159
[client] He's been there all along.

38:08.619 --> 38:10.121
- Ma'am.
- [client] Oh, yes?

38:24.593 --> 38:27.054
["The Giving Tree"
by Lee Seung Yoon playing]

38:27.138 --> 38:28.514
[Yeon-su] I have forgotten…

38:44.196 --> 38:45.698
What are you doing here?

38:46.866 --> 38:48.409
…that the person I loved…

38:49.618 --> 38:51.162
Are you here to see me?

38:53.039 --> 38:55.750
Why did you want to meet on the weekend?

38:56.959 --> 38:58.127
What?

38:59.337 --> 39:00.504
I can't

39:01.630 --> 39:02.590
wait that long.

39:03.507 --> 39:06.302
[Yeon-su] Whether he was
the same person or not…

39:06.385 --> 39:08.888
Go on. I won't get in your way.

39:10.931 --> 39:12.600
[Ung] I didn't know about this place.

39:13.434 --> 39:15.770
I should hold my exhibition here someday.

39:20.316 --> 39:21.484
Oh.

39:22.651 --> 39:23.652
[Yeon-su] It's Ung.

39:24.153 --> 39:26.447
I just loved him for who he is.

39:28.199 --> 39:30.409
["The Giving Tree" continues playing]

39:34.955 --> 39:37.750
It won't take long.
Just wait here a little.

39:45.007 --> 39:47.009
[deep exhale]
I was right.

39:48.219 --> 39:49.720
It is too far away.

39:54.433 --> 39:56.477
- [client] Isn't it wonderful?
- [Yeon-su] Yes.

39:56.560 --> 39:58.396
- I think you should cover this place too.
- Okay.

39:58.479 --> 40:01.899
Over here is the pottery exhibition.
You wanna check it out?

40:06.153 --> 40:09.740
We've installed shelves by the walls,
so that the children can approach them.

40:09.824 --> 40:12.576
There's are more exhibition halls
upstairs, follow me. This way.

40:15.746 --> 40:17.832
["The Giving Tree" playing]

40:25.339 --> 40:27.383
EDITING ROOM

40:37.184 --> 40:39.895
Ji-ung, are you certain that
you're feeling much better now?

40:39.979 --> 40:43.107
Hmm. You took
my temperature earlier, right?

40:44.650 --> 40:47.361
Are you happy about something?

40:48.487 --> 40:49.613
No.

40:55.327 --> 40:57.079
Can we use a different insert for this?

40:57.163 --> 40:59.874
Uh… Yes. I'll find you one.

41:00.875 --> 41:01.876
[sighs]

41:03.919 --> 41:05.087
Thank you.

41:17.600 --> 41:19.351
HOT AND SAVORY ROASTED CHESTNUTS

41:20.352 --> 41:22.146
♪ I'm driving so far ♪

41:22.229 --> 41:24.982
♪ Tell me when you ♪

41:25.566 --> 41:28.110
♪ Coming to me and say ♪

41:28.194 --> 41:30.654
♪ You want me again ♪

41:31.530 --> 41:33.365
♪ Never wanna lose me ♪

41:34.700 --> 41:35.951
This feels like

41:36.577 --> 41:38.412
we're already on a date.

41:42.333 --> 41:45.836
It finally feels like
we're in a relationship again.

41:50.591 --> 41:51.884
It took a while,

41:52.968 --> 41:53.844
didn't it?

41:55.971 --> 41:58.516
["Our Beloved Summer"
by Kim Kyung Hee playing]

42:05.856 --> 42:07.399
Darn these corn dogs.

42:07.483 --> 42:08.776
[laughs]

42:09.610 --> 42:11.820
- Can you hold this for me?
- No way.

42:12.488 --> 42:13.614
Okay, then.

42:14.114 --> 42:18.577
♪ …when you coming to me and say ♪

42:18.661 --> 42:21.539
♪ You want me again ♪

42:21.622 --> 42:24.166
♪ Never wanna lose me ♪

42:25.543 --> 42:28.212
♪ 'Cause I'll be missing you ♪

42:28.295 --> 42:30.297
♪ Together, together ♪

42:30.381 --> 42:31.882
♪ Together, together ♪

42:35.344 --> 42:37.137
- Do you want a corn dog?
- [chuckles]

42:38.514 --> 42:40.182
♪ Together, together ♪

42:40.266 --> 42:42.101
♪ Together, together ♪

42:42.184 --> 42:44.061
- Let's go.
- It looks tasty.

42:45.729 --> 42:47.565
BEGIN AGAIN

42:51.777 --> 42:53.070
[NJ] Mr. Kim.

42:54.321 --> 42:56.532
Hey, what was that about? You just saw me.

42:56.615 --> 42:59.410
- Were you really just going to walk by?
- What brings you here?

42:59.493 --> 43:01.537
You know I'm doing a special documentary.

43:02.997 --> 43:04.999
Is Mr. Choi done with his part?

43:05.082 --> 43:08.002
How's it going?
I'm really looking forward to watching it.

43:08.085 --> 43:10.921
We're done with the shooting already,
and we're editing it right now.

43:11.005 --> 43:12.006
Will you use my footage too?

43:13.132 --> 43:15.342
By the way, how is Mr. Choi doing?

43:15.426 --> 43:18.345
Is he still busy even after the shoot,

43:18.429 --> 43:20.347
or is he just
pretending to be at the moment?

43:20.431 --> 43:22.725
[sighs]
I can't seem to ever reach him.

43:26.854 --> 43:28.022
[soft sad music]

43:33.402 --> 43:36.071
Mr. Kim, is that your dinner?

43:36.155 --> 43:38.449
That won't fill you up,
you know. Chi-seong.

43:38.532 --> 43:40.367
Oh. Goodbye. Yes?

43:40.451 --> 43:41.535
Am I done for today?

43:41.619 --> 43:44.872
Hmm. I thought
you were going to head home.

43:44.955 --> 43:47.499
I'm going to have dinner
with Mr. Kim over there.

43:47.583 --> 43:48.917
You two?

43:49.501 --> 43:52.838
What do you say?
I have some things to ask you anyway.

43:52.921 --> 43:55.132
I was just gonna have
a light meal while editing.

43:56.300 --> 43:57.885
Are you that busy?

43:59.178 --> 44:01.013
Uh, well…

44:04.558 --> 44:05.684
Now, tell me.

44:07.186 --> 44:09.313
What was that look on your face?

44:09.396 --> 44:10.439
What look?

44:10.522 --> 44:13.275
When I said earlier
that I couldn't reach Mr. Choi,

44:14.652 --> 44:16.820
this was the look on your face.

44:18.364 --> 44:20.240
That's just how I normally look.

44:20.324 --> 44:22.743
That's not true. I clearly saw it.

44:22.826 --> 44:23.952
[chuckles awkwardly]

44:24.953 --> 44:26.997
[NJ] What is it? Tell me.

44:27.081 --> 44:28.916
Do people know that he rejected me?

44:33.170 --> 44:36.256
It's more like
you're the one who's telling people.

44:36.340 --> 44:40.177
Then do they all know that we're
simply acting like the rumors are true?

44:40.260 --> 44:42.930
Sorry, but that's pretty much
what you're telling me right now.

44:43.806 --> 44:46.475
Then do they also know
that Mr. Choi likes Ms. Kook?

44:48.018 --> 44:49.520
I guess they do.

44:51.021 --> 44:52.648
Could he not hide it any better?

44:53.774 --> 44:55.025
You're telling me you knew?

44:55.109 --> 44:57.319
Then they'll soon know
that the feelings are mutual.

44:58.278 --> 44:59.571
[amazed huff]

44:59.655 --> 45:01.407
I see you seem to know a lot of things.

45:03.742 --> 45:05.327
So do you want anything else?

45:05.411 --> 45:08.038
Excuse me, can we get
a bottle of beer and soju?

45:08.122 --> 45:08.956
[server] Sure.

45:09.039 --> 45:11.375
That order's for me.
You can order for yourself.

45:13.252 --> 45:15.129
We can't be sober for this conversation.

45:19.633 --> 45:22.511
[Yeon-su] Tell me, how did you know
that I'd be there today?

45:22.594 --> 45:25.681
Someone from your team told me.
It was Ye-in, I think.

45:26.306 --> 45:28.392
What made you want to contact her?

45:28.475 --> 45:30.102
She called me first.

45:30.185 --> 45:31.270
For what reason?

45:31.895 --> 45:35.190
She was the only person
who asked if the scandal was true.

45:36.150 --> 45:38.444
Oh, those rumors, eh?

45:41.947 --> 45:42.948
[nervous chuckle]

45:43.449 --> 45:47.744
Well. I'm sure you already know,
but it wasn't true.

45:53.041 --> 45:56.044
Isn't it funny? That it was
all because I know a celebrity.

45:56.128 --> 45:56.962
Huh.

45:59.423 --> 46:01.049
- But…
- Mm?

46:01.717 --> 46:04.178
- …the photos were real.
- [Ung] What?

46:05.262 --> 46:08.432
I didn't know you were close enough
to go over to her house.

46:09.224 --> 46:11.768
Hold on. I'm sure you could tell
by the photos,

46:11.852 --> 46:13.645
but I only went in front of her house.

46:13.729 --> 46:15.939
Who knows?
No one could take photos inside.

46:16.023 --> 46:19.651
It's true, though. I was invited to go
inside but I turned it down in the end.

46:20.444 --> 46:22.112
She invited you inside?

46:22.988 --> 46:26.074
She also invited Eun-ho, I think.

46:26.158 --> 46:28.744
So she invited you over.

46:28.827 --> 46:31.330
Hold on.
Is that really important right now?

46:32.080 --> 46:36.043
You see, it wasn't before.
But now I'm not so sure.

46:36.627 --> 46:38.921
Wait, wait, wait.
[sighs]

46:42.758 --> 46:43.634
We're here.

46:43.717 --> 46:46.428
Wait, don't go and make this seem awkward.

46:47.012 --> 46:47.971
Hey.

46:49.181 --> 46:51.683
Oh look, you're in front
of another woman's house.

46:51.767 --> 46:52.684
Come on.

46:52.768 --> 46:55.103
Looks like you do this often.
You've really changed.

46:55.187 --> 46:56.438
That's enough.

46:57.648 --> 46:59.691
Do you know what it is
that I hate the most right now?

46:59.775 --> 47:00.817
What?

47:00.901 --> 47:02.528
We're not students anymore, you know.

47:04.029 --> 47:06.281
You don't have to go home early.

47:07.074 --> 47:07.908
[chuckles softly]

47:07.991 --> 47:09.368
Come back outside.

47:09.910 --> 47:11.578
[cheery music]

47:15.457 --> 47:16.917
- [Ung] Come here.
- [Yeon-su chuckling]

47:17.000 --> 47:18.669
It's still too early to go home.

47:18.752 --> 47:20.379
Got that? You can't go.

47:20.462 --> 47:21.838
[chuckles]

47:22.381 --> 47:24.633
- [Ja-gyeong] Who's there outside?
- [both gasp]

47:24.716 --> 47:25.884
Yeon-su?

47:27.844 --> 47:32.057
Who would still be up at this hour?
Good for nothing brats.

47:32.140 --> 47:33.559
[both chuckling]

47:42.901 --> 47:43.944
Would you like to…

47:47.573 --> 47:50.284
- come over for some jujube tea?
- What?

47:50.367 --> 47:51.952
I'm being serious.

47:52.035 --> 47:54.204
I want to get rid of all of that…

47:54.288 --> 47:55.330
I mean…

47:56.331 --> 47:57.207
Let's have some together.

47:57.291 --> 47:58.667
[laughs]

47:59.251 --> 48:00.210
[phone buzzing]

48:02.170 --> 48:04.256
Pick it up. It's okay.

48:18.020 --> 48:21.898
Or do you want to go see
something lame with me?

48:24.067 --> 48:27.446
And at the very least I saw it coming,

48:27.529 --> 48:31.700
I knew about it somehow,
deep inside, so I wasn't that shocked.

48:37.331 --> 48:38.165
Thanks.

48:44.463 --> 48:45.631
[gulps, groans]

48:47.007 --> 48:48.133
[NJ] The thing is,

48:49.009 --> 48:53.388
I didn't really see any harm
in having a crush

48:53.472 --> 48:55.349
since I never had one before.

48:55.891 --> 48:57.726
But now that I do,

48:57.809 --> 49:00.437
I would feel motivated
every single morning

49:00.520 --> 49:04.191
and become hopeful
even over the tiniest of things.

49:05.067 --> 49:09.029
It makes me feel as if
I'm really special inside.

49:09.112 --> 49:10.822
[NJ laughs]

49:10.906 --> 49:14.534
On top of that,
my imagination started going wild.

49:14.618 --> 49:16.912
I even thought about becoming a writer.

49:16.995 --> 49:20.332
And I actually thought
it was my true calling.

49:20.415 --> 49:22.167
[laughs]

49:22.250 --> 49:25.962
This all came to me
after I started having a crush on him.

49:27.673 --> 49:30.092
So how great do you think that is?

49:32.386 --> 49:34.429
[bubbly music]

49:42.479 --> 49:43.480
No way!

49:43.980 --> 49:46.858
This feeling I have for him
honestly sucks!

49:46.942 --> 49:49.152
How could he make me feel so miserable?

49:49.236 --> 49:51.363
[slow sad music]

49:52.072 --> 49:54.658
I feel like a worthless person

49:54.741 --> 49:57.953
who had the audacity
to come between their grand love.

49:59.454 --> 50:01.707
Do you get what I mean, Mr. Kim?

50:07.129 --> 50:09.673
It's so annoying that I gave up like that.

50:11.341 --> 50:12.384
[sobs]

50:13.427 --> 50:15.470
I take back what I just said.

50:16.930 --> 50:17.931
I know.

50:19.808 --> 50:21.059
Know what?

50:22.811 --> 50:24.521
That I can't give up on him?

50:26.857 --> 50:28.775
So annoying.

50:28.859 --> 50:31.361
Oh? Don't get me wrong.

50:31.445 --> 50:32.696
I'm don't mean you.

50:32.779 --> 50:36.533
I'm talking about
this dumb situation that I'm in.

50:37.117 --> 50:39.327
[gentle music]

50:39.870 --> 50:41.079
[sighs]

50:42.497 --> 50:43.790
It'll get better.

50:46.585 --> 50:48.044
Having a crush on someone

50:49.629 --> 50:51.673
can be really hard at first.

50:51.757 --> 50:53.341
After a while,

50:54.426 --> 50:55.761
it gets even worse.

50:57.137 --> 50:58.096
[Ji-ung] Eventually…

50:59.473 --> 51:01.433
it becomes really unbearable.

51:02.434 --> 51:03.602
After that…

51:05.812 --> 51:07.522
you kind of just get used to it.

51:08.607 --> 51:11.860
Does that mean
that one day I'll be able to give up?

51:12.486 --> 51:13.445
No.

51:15.697 --> 51:19.201
You get used to the pain. So used to it…

51:20.577 --> 51:22.454
that you eventually become numb…

51:24.664 --> 51:28.293
and the pain doesn't even hurt anymore.

51:31.922 --> 51:33.048
Then…

51:35.550 --> 51:38.094
when does it finally stop?

51:40.514 --> 51:41.890
Well…

51:46.186 --> 51:47.979
[scoffs]
I hadn't thought of that.

51:49.564 --> 51:53.109
Having a crush sucks big time.

51:57.531 --> 51:58.865
[chuckles]

51:59.783 --> 52:01.451
Thanks a lot

52:01.535 --> 52:05.497
for helping me to come to my senses.
[chuckles]

52:14.840 --> 52:18.218
[Yeon-su] The gallery at this hour?
Isn't it closed?

52:18.301 --> 52:19.761
[Ung] It won't take very long. I promise.

52:23.139 --> 52:25.392
Wait. You have the entrance card?

52:29.813 --> 52:30.897
Would you like to come in?

52:42.492 --> 52:45.620
Is this where you'll be holding
your solo exhibition?

52:45.704 --> 52:46.580
[Ung] Mm.

52:47.789 --> 52:52.252
Oh. I really forgot about
what a great artist you are.

52:52.335 --> 52:53.211
Mr. Choi.

52:55.881 --> 52:59.342
Although, why did you
have to come here at this hour?

52:59.968 --> 53:03.346
Mm… I was actually thinking of holding
a nighttime exhibition.

53:03.430 --> 53:04.514
Late at night?

53:04.598 --> 53:07.434
Mm. It'll last through the entire night.

53:08.810 --> 53:12.606
I doubt many people will come
if it's being held too late.

53:12.689 --> 53:14.816
Promoting it won't be easy either.

53:14.900 --> 53:17.277
That's why my idea keeps getting rejected.

53:18.737 --> 53:22.532
I guess artists really do
think differently from us normal people.

53:23.742 --> 53:25.160
But seriously, why at this hour?

53:26.536 --> 53:29.748
Because it's the same time
when I drew all of them.

53:29.831 --> 53:30.999
And plus…

53:32.876 --> 53:35.003
it's also when I'm always awake.

53:53.480 --> 53:55.899
["Christmas Tree" by V playing]

53:59.486 --> 54:03.031
♪ In this moment ♪

54:03.114 --> 54:06.284
♪ I see you ♪

54:06.368 --> 54:11.539
♪ It always comes around as I believed ♪

54:13.041 --> 54:16.670
♪ When the rain stops ♪

54:16.753 --> 54:20.131
♪ You shine on me ♪

54:20.215 --> 54:23.635
♪ Your light's the only thing… ♪

54:23.718 --> 54:24.844
Just now,

54:26.262 --> 54:29.599
I imagined the time you spent
up alone at this hour.

54:31.267 --> 54:32.769
It must have been lonely.

54:36.356 --> 54:39.442
What goes through your mind
when you're drawing?

54:43.863 --> 54:45.198
What do you think about

54:46.616 --> 54:49.494
in that long span of time, Ung?

54:52.747 --> 54:53.581
[Ung] I'm not sure.

54:54.916 --> 54:56.459
I never really thought about it.

54:59.254 --> 55:03.049
But I think nothing could ever be
as perfect as this.

55:04.050 --> 55:08.722
♪ I just want to be where you are ♪

55:09.389 --> 55:12.017
♪ It's such a strange thing to do… ♪

55:14.394 --> 55:17.731
[Ung] Every thin line that I drew…

55:19.315 --> 55:20.567
Every second

55:21.735 --> 55:23.028
that went by…

55:31.369 --> 55:32.871
Every year…

55:37.542 --> 55:38.918
Every moment…

55:41.588 --> 55:44.841
Yeon-su was always there, always present.

55:48.595 --> 55:49.721
What imagination?

55:51.431 --> 55:52.932
[Ung] And from now on…

56:00.899 --> 56:02.442
I will spend all my time…

56:10.992 --> 56:13.119
loving Kook Yeon-su.

56:29.636 --> 56:30.845
Shall we go home?

56:32.847 --> 56:33.681
Mm.

56:34.933 --> 56:37.310
♪ So I'll tell you ♪

56:37.393 --> 56:40.980
♪ A million tiny things that ♪

56:41.064 --> 56:44.776
♪ You have never known ♪

56:44.859 --> 56:48.404
♪ It all gets tangled up inside ♪

56:48.488 --> 56:51.032
♪ And I'll tell you ♪

56:51.116 --> 56:54.577
♪ A million little reasons ♪

56:54.661 --> 56:58.039
♪ I'm falling for your eyes ♪

56:58.748 --> 57:03.294
♪ I just want to be where you are ♪

57:03.378 --> 57:04.712
♪ Tell you ♪

57:05.213 --> 57:08.299
♪ A million tiny things that ♪

57:08.383 --> 57:11.469
♪ You have never known ♪

57:12.220 --> 57:15.807
♪ It all gets tangled up inside ♪

57:15.890 --> 57:17.058
EPILOGUE

57:17.142 --> 57:18.726
♪ Tell you ♪

57:18.810 --> 57:22.230
♪ A million little reasons ♪

57:22.313 --> 57:26.109
♪ I'm falling for your eyes ♪

57:26.192 --> 57:29.529
♪ I just want to be where you are ♪

57:29.612 --> 57:32.365
[Ji-ung] If there truly is
an end to this crush,

57:33.700 --> 57:36.327
I hope that it comes to an end right now.

57:37.412 --> 57:38.621
[groaning sigh]

57:57.724 --> 57:58.892
[sighs]

58:07.442 --> 58:10.111
Huh, your fever's gone. I'm leaving now.

58:10.195 --> 58:12.071
I told you to leave earlier, didn't I?

58:12.155 --> 58:13.573
[Ung sighs]

58:16.951 --> 58:18.745
What is it? You have more to say?

58:22.957 --> 58:25.585
Hey, do you want to move in with me?

58:25.668 --> 58:26.794
Huh?

58:26.878 --> 58:31.424
Your place kind of feels a bit lonely.

58:33.468 --> 58:35.011
Cut the nonsense and go.

58:35.094 --> 58:36.638
Oh. Thank goodness.

58:37.430 --> 58:39.265
I was worried you'd say yes.

58:39.349 --> 58:40.725
[chuckles]

58:40.808 --> 58:41.893
[Ung] Rest up.

58:42.477 --> 58:44.687
Okay? You should always sleep at home.

58:45.438 --> 58:47.649
And that includes my place too.

58:52.487 --> 58:54.489
[Ji-ung] I'm so sick and tired of it.

58:57.116 --> 59:00.578
Of always… being the bad guy.

59:03.206 --> 59:10.213
BEGIN AGAIN

59:11.047 --> 59:14.217
["Home" by Janet Suhh playing]

59:30.858 --> 59:34.195
[Ung] You know what?
I want to keep living in this world.

59:34.821 --> 59:38.199
[Yeon-su] Biggest misfortune always comes
disguised as happiness.

59:38.283 --> 59:39.701
It's nothing, really.

59:40.702 --> 59:42.829
Let's just ignore everything for now.

59:42.912 --> 59:43.955
[gasps]

59:44.038 --> 59:45.373
I'm not going to be friends with you.

59:45.873 --> 59:47.875
[Chae-ran] How are you going to end it?

59:47.959 --> 59:51.004
Hey Ji-ung… Why aren't you looking at me?

59:51.879 --> 59:54.215
[Eun-ho] I don't get
why you're seeing Yeon-su again.

59:54.299 --> 59:56.884
[Yeon-su] They say couples who fight
and break up often…

59:56.968 --> 59:59.012
What are you doing, Yeon-su?

59:59.095 --> 01:00:01.055
[Yeon-su] …have a higher chance
of breaking up again.
